+    /* ------------------------------------------------------------------
+       Ink lines: decorative text lines (underline / overline / strike)
+       ------------------------------------------------------------------
+       Each `.ink` element draws its line with a ::after pseudo-element that
+       sits *behind* the glyphs (isolation + z-index: -1). The line's colour
+       is a plain background and its shape comes from a mask, so solid rules,
+       dotted runs, waves and hand-drawn brush strokes all share one engine.
