+         --ink-skip        page/background colour painted as a tight text
+                           shadow so the line skips cleanly around
+                           descenders (g, p, y, j). `transparent` disables.
+         --ink-mask / --ink-mask-size / --ink-mask-repeat
+                           custom shape of the line
+         --ink-duration / --ink-delay / --ink-ease
+                           reveal timing
+         --ink-origin      reveal direction for scale wipes (left|center|right)
+       ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
